oom.  Newer high efficient furnace, 100 amp electrical, new stucco on exterior.  Large insulated double garage has been rebuilt in the back along with additional parking.  Lots of long term potential with the lot and move in ready home as is; or renovate it to make it your dream home for years to come. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$558,800"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,453 sq ft"],["Lot size","6,500 sq ft"],["Year built","1951"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Parkallen"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6H4R4"],["MLS® number","E4504714"],["Listed","August 20, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.74 m × 3.76 m (18'10\" × 12'4\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.70 m × 2.40 m (12'2\" × 7'10\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.30 m × 2.50 m (14'1\" × 8'2\")"],["Den","Basement","4.00 m × 2.60 m (13'1\" × 8'6\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","5.50 m × 3.10 m (18'1\" × 10'2\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","5.50 m × 3.10 m (18'1\" × 10'2\")"],["Bedroom 3","Main level","3.78 m × 3.10 m (12'5\" × 10'2\")"],["Second Kitchen","Basement","3.22 m × 3.10 m (10'7\" × 10'2\")"]],"courtesy":"Curtis Leibel, MaxWell Devonshire Realty and Luke Flanagan, MaxWell Devonshire Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"parkallen","area":"southwest-edmonton"}